  "result": "Edited three files to fix both problems. I did not run the test suite, since the task asked for the edit only.\n\n- `src/server/repositories/organization-repository.ts`: `updateOrg` unioned the stored overrides with the incoming list, so removing one was undone on every write. It now replaces the stored set when the patch includes overrides, and keeps the stored set when it doesn't.\n- `src/server/services/feature-flag-service.ts`: `toggleFlag` rejected only non-overridable flags that were not plan-gated. It now rejects every non-overridable flag, including `webhooks`.\n- `src/lib/feature-flags.ts`: `isEnabled` now honours a stored override only when the flag is overridable, so a stale override on a non-overridable flag has no effect.",
